  "description": ".NET PDF-417 Barcode Reader on Excel SDK is a C# barcode scanner library to read, scan PDF-417 and other 2d and 1d barcode formats on Excel in your .NET ASP.NET web and Windows apps.\n\n.NET Barcode Reader library is an advanced C# barcode scanner library :\n * Read and decode QR Code, Data Matrix, PDF-417, Code 39 / 128, EAN/UPC, and other barcode formats\n * Scan, detect multiple barcode formats from a single file with fast reading speed and high recognition rate\n * Scan multiple barcodes with different barcode formats from a single image file\n * Reading barcodes from GIF, BMP, JPEG, PNG image files, and stream objects\n * Reading barcodes from Adobe PDF, Microsoft Office Word, Excel, PowerPoint documents and multi-page TIFF image files\n\nCompatible with :\n* .NET Standard 2.0\n* .NET 8, .NET 7, .NET 6, .NET 5\n* .NET Core 3.x, & 2.x\n* .NET Framework 4.6.1\n\nDocuments\n* How to Guide : http://www.keepdynamic.com/barcoding/csharp-barcode-reader.shtml\n* Email : support@keepdynamic.com",
